      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/contribution/codeofconduct/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;code-of-conduct&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Code of Conduct&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/contribution/codeofconduct/#code-of-conduct&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Code of Conduct&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Code of Conduct&#34; href=&#34;#code-of-conduct&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;our-pledge&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Our Pledge&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/contribution/codeofconduct/#our-pledge&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Our Pledge&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Our Pledge&#34; href=&#34;#our-pledge&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In the interest of fostering an open and welcoming environment, we as&#xA;contributors and maintainers pledge to making participation in our project and&#xA;our community a harassment-free experience for everyone, regardless of age, body&#xA;size, disability, ethnicity, gender identity and expression, level of experience,&#xA;nationality, personal appearance, race, religion, or sexual identity and&#xA;orientation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
